Note on the Second Edition

The Second Edition of Unified Paths of Light (now renamed: Sacred Codes and Civilizational Longevity) resulted in a slightly different core set of Blainey’s Laws — or, arguably, a slightly different interpretation of the underlying core ethics.
It remains to be determined whether this difference results from the changes to the religious texts and traditions used in the Second Edition, or from the use of a slightly different and more refined methodology.
In either case, an important question is how this variant of Blainey’s Laws performs when applied to the Concord, and whether it produces any meaningful differences in its principles, structure, or outcomes.
